AI.\n*Esp cannot track everywhere: Not script issue, it is game limited what can be loaded, and esp will keep scan to find any existing target on your client!\n\n-Features-\n+ESP: Player, submarine, drone, UAV.\n+Tracer. The number next to it is distance before tracer triggers (Tracer looks laggy because it was made to rise your awareness, as well to save your device from toasted)\n+Night vision.\n+Ghost Head: Make all your shoots \"near\" enemy will be count as headshot, only work for firearms.\n+Tween to Oil Rigs, Tycoons, Collector, AirDrop(using tween so game can load)\n+Oil Rig tracker (🛢️is ready, ⚡is filling, 🕳️ is empty)\n+AirDrop tracker (📦is ready, 🕳️ is empty, if the tab empty then that mean no airdrop)\n+Fall damage immunity.\n+Player orbit: make you spin around someone for better shoot until they died or you deorbit)\n+KOS: Toggle to white list someone, white listed player will have special esp/tracer and wont be affect by Ghost Head.\n+Day/Night: change time in your client.\n+GUI color: u can make the ui have ur own like color (only border)\n+You be able to save config (didnt test cuz lazy)\n+GUI Keybind: it show LeftControl as default, but it is actually empty. Click it to set your own.\n+You can relaunch the script many time as it will clean the older.\n\n-Hover your mouse on tabs, scroll the middle mouse to browse.\n-May have some visual issue on mobile since I didnt tested.\n-Some features wont work on potato executors (e.g Xeno, Solara, JJSpoit...)\n\nBonus info: I was plan to made this private use. But devs banned me, so I decided to take avenge by publishing this publicly 💀","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"671746b43f20580b2641a6c6","username":"Alone2718","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4c4c700fcf0dc7284ac0d6f9b3ee5352e06e8047738a265a78e4f1d8c82422b5.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/671746b43f20580b2641a6c6-1776055139917.png"},"status":"offline","id":"671746b43f20580b2641a